# AI Tech Stack Recommender

An AI-powered recommendation system that matches user skills with technology career paths using cosine similarity and skill vectorization.

## Features

* Skill-based job recommendations
* Cosine similarity scoring
* Fuzzy skill matching
* Skill weighting
* Domain filtering
* Experience-level filtering
* Explainable recommendations
* Interactive Gradio dashboard
* Recommendation score visualization

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Scikit-Learn
* Plotly
* Gradio

## Project Pipeline

1. User enters skills
2. Skills are cleaned and normalized
3. Skills are converted into vectors
4. Cosine similarity is calculated
5. Jobs are ranked by similarity score
6. Top recommendations are displayed

